[{"client_msg_id":"e4eb63b9-b4ed-4c10-8c3e-97536008a067","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"プロジェク全体ファイルにもちょっと手がだせないやつなので、ありがたいのですがそれも無理そう...","ts":"1629467606.014200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"EOOY"}]},{"client_msg_id":"31d8d7d9-8eb7-4729-8b3d-0fe59e19413f","type":"message","user":"U7TMPGWJ0","text":"setup.cfg で per-file-ignores とか \u003chttps://flake8.pycqa.org/en/latest/user/options.html?highlight=per-file-ignores#cmdoption-flake8-per-file-ignores\u003e","ts":"1629467522.013600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"tj/f"}]},{"client_msg_id":"57c32aeb-f1a4-4734-a3ee-9f7ad7a97773","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"あーなるほどw","ts":"1629467375.013400","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"V=Wl"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9c8beb84-83b9-479b-9c9a-d575c1a59ba5","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"いえ、逆に特定のテストコードにだけ処置が必要になったので...","ts":"1629467356.013000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"U2Mo"}]},{"client_msg_id":"d273076a-16fa-4693-8aba-f563b3451092","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"プロジェクト全部で ignore するのなら setup.cfg あたりで ignore 書くとかはダメでしょうか？","ts":"1629467295.012500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"YRFK"}]},{"client_msg_id":"899f2b38-32f1-4f98-9336-0c1de8ce5e38","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"ありがとうございます。諦めてファイルの先頭で全部無視するにするしかないか","ts":"1629467038.011700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"mqk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"9d42fdd3-0254-4b5b-a195-d140fe538a8b","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"\u003chttps://github.com/PyCQA/flake8/blob/542145fb7cda98375467554a4070e232ba37f865/src/flake8/processor.py#L354-L374\u003e\nチェック箇所。","ts":"1629466989.011100","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/PyCQA/flake8/blob/542145fb7cda98375467554a4070e232ba37f865/src/flake8/processor.py | processor.py\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/PyCQA/flake8/blob/542145fb7cda98375467554a4070e232ba37f865/src/flake8/processor.py | processor.py\u003e","text":"```\n    def should_ignore_file(self) -\u0026gt; bool:\n        \"\"\"Check if ``flake8: noqa`` is in the file to be ignored.\n\n        :returns:\n            True if a line matches :attr:`defaults.NOQA_FILE`,\n            otherwise False\n        :rtype:\n            bool\n        \"\"\"\n        if not self.options.disable_noqa and any(\n            defaults.NOQA_FILE.match(line) for line in self.lines\n        ):\n            return True\n        elif any(defaults.NOQA_FILE.search(line) for line in self.lines):\n            LOG.warning(\n                \"Detected `flake8: noqa` on line with code. To ignore an \"\n                \"error on a line use `noqa` instead.\"\n            )\n            return False\n        else:\n            return False\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/PyCQA/flake8|PyCQA/flake8\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"azKBn"}]},{"client_msg_id":"19b7ed0a-6b21-49ac-bb2f-040e9d8bfad6","type":"message","user":"U78A6ESHM","text":"多分できないかと。コード読んでも種別指定は受け付けてないみたいです。\n\u003chttps://github.com/PyCQA/flake8/blob/542145fb7cda98375467554a4070e232ba37f865/src/flake8/defaults.py#L44\u003e\n該当の正規表現。","ts":"1629466906.010800","attachments":[{"color":"24292f","fallback":"\u003chttps://github.com/PyCQA/flake8/blob/542145fb7cda98375467554a4070e232ba37f865/src/flake8/defaults.py | defaults.py\u003e","id":1,"title":"\u003chttps://github.com/PyCQA/flake8/blob/542145fb7cda98375467554a4070e232ba37f865/src/flake8/defaults.py | defaults.py\u003e","text":"```\nNOQA_FILE = re.compile(r\"\\s*# flake8[:=]\\s*noqa\", re.I)\n```","mrkdwn_in":["text"],"blocks":null,"footer":"\u003chttps://github.com/PyCQA/flake8|PyCQA/flake8\u003e","footer_icon":"https://slack.github.com/static/img/favicon-neutral.png"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"Ev1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"91845189-b84d-4dea-b013-46af66b689a9","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"もしくは pylint と flake8 のエラー無視をコメント1つで両立する方法、でもいいのですが...","ts":"1629449146.009300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"8/aa"}]},{"client_msg_id":"2c02fbc0-1b8f-4cfc-91bc-7e52baee415f","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"`質問です`\npythonなんですが、flake8のエラー無視として、ファイル単位コメント `# flake8: noqa` と各行コメント `# noqa` があります\n行のほうは、エラーの種別指定 `# noqa: Exxx`  がありますが、ファイル単位のやつで指定する記法ってありますか?\nちょっといろいろやってみたけどダメっぽい \u0026amp; 情報がみつからないから、たぶんないんだろうけど...","ts":"1629449052.008600","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"FUJse"}]},{"client_msg_id":"861ad763-1384-4334-8c20-c2c9216d3733","type":"message","user":"UAZ33BKV2","text":"自分もおなじボケやってるかも、再確認しよう....","ts":"1629447562.006500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pAlyQ"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5e1837d7-1792-4f83-9386-5213d72083b6","type":"message","user":"U028ZMX11E1","text":"解決しました\nありがとうございました…","ts":"1629447162.006200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"lZda1"}]},{"client_msg_id":"f1e03c1e-8aa6-4770-9065-1e9f9e790caa","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"`on_ft` とか、必要ですね","ts":"1629447137.005600","team":"T03C4RC8V","reactions":[{"name":"+1","count":3,"users":["U028ZMX11E1","U7JL1UKKL","U01BY3SDBRS"]}],"replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"UcN4"}]},{"client_msg_id":"64c30174-22b2-40ea-8ad8-6a383d15023d","type":"message","user":"U028ZMX11E1","text":"あ、ifってlazyのトリガーではないんですね……\n完全に勘違いしてました","ts":"1629447119.005100","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"39jy"}]},{"client_msg_id":"04f9cc9b-376c-4ee1-878d-20ad0b2160f9","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"if で切り分けたいだけなら、非 lazy で良いような","ts":"1629447118.005000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rtJj"}]},{"client_msg_id":"5d72b377-0a48-4fe2-9dc1-0eb83c9a4eac","type":"message","user":"U06ECBRTJ","text":"lazy だと、トリガーが無いと読み込まれないんじゃないですかね","ts":"1629447072.004300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"VzT"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0c5863d2-4585-419e-851e-08fbaa26c728","type":"message","user":"U028ZMX11E1","text":"具体的には、\n・nvimを開くとairlineがインストールされ、そのあとvimを開くとairlineが読み込まれないので正常そう\n・しかし、nvimを開いて閉じたあと再びnvimを起動すると、今度はairlineが読み込まれない\nというものです","ts":"1629447001.003700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pFx"}]},{"client_msg_id":"3e825b8d-6fb4-4441-b1af-e20cd8f7b371","type":"message","user":"U028ZMX11E1","text":"dein.vimのlazyのifについて質問なんですが、ここにあるような`.vimrc`を書いてinit.vimにシンボリックリンクを貼った状態で、~/.vim/dein_lazy.tomlに以下のようなものを書いたとき変な挙動を起こしてて、それが正常なのかどうか聞きたいです\n```[[plugins]]\nrepo = 'vim-airline/vim-airline'\nif = 'has(\"nvim\")'```","ts":"1629446892.002000","edited":{"user":"U028ZMX11E1","ts":"1629447057.000000"},"files":[{"id":"F02BDA1QDM5","created":1629446890,"timestamp":1629446890,"name":".vimrc","title":".vimrc","mimetype":"application/octet-stream","image_exif_rotation":0,"filetype":"binary","pretty_type":"バイナリ","user":"U028ZMX11E1","mode":"hosted","editable":false,"is_external":false,"external_typ